---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for interpretBaseline. Reconcile surveys, field notes, and historical records into a baseline with explicit spatial, temporal, and methodological limits. Distinguish observed absence from unsurveyed areas and preserve rare or uncertain observations for specialist review. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
